{"title": "Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice (Condition)", "pageid": 45217, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action Soul Sacrifice Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>When a humanoid dies, the Ch'r'ai can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/38px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/50px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp/25px-Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Sacrifice_Soul_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_Soul\" title=\"Sacrifice Soul\">Sacrifice</a> its soul to Vlaakith in return for great power.</li>\n<li>Once 3 souls have been sacrificed, the Ch'r'ai takes on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith%27s_Undying_Aspect_(Condition)\" title=\"Vlaakith's Undying Aspect (Condition)\">Vlaakith's Undying Aspect</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice\">Sources of Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a5/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a5/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a5/Legendary_Action_Soul_Sacrifice_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice\" title=\"Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice\">Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Legendary_Action:_Soul_Sacrifice\">Creatures with Legendary Action: Soul Sacrifice</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/30px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/45px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/60px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tska'an\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png/30px-Portrait_Tska%27an.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Portrait_Tska%27an.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tska%27an\" title=\"Tska'an\">Tska'an</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can sacrifice a soul to Vlaakith in return for great power.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062428\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1669/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24354/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9482/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968607/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.407      1 -total\n 99.30%   50.055      1 Template:Condition_page\n 78.32%   39.477      3 Template